        "slc_b36ccd1af9c2fd7487f8fa17abada47e7a0e7c55253d7f814a569e18df895efa"
      ],
      "text": "The architecture is described as Guard modules around coding agents: Context, Hallucination, Boundary, Regression, Evidence, Impact, and Loop Guards, plus an Executor Adapter and Trace Normalizer."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3e6c402bbfa9db0f736dea9ecf2172bb812f08ea2fbc3343c7a1335856e05adb",
