          "repository": "whut09/opencode-plusplus",
          "url": "https://github.com/whut09/opencode-plusplus/blob/598767170bb73e869293c6a91526bcb852b696c0/docs/concepts/architecture.md#L145-L149"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_cab66952cf84209e62067fde3ba259384c2b97b9fe3f36fc67d086380f24f009"
      ],
      "text": "The v2 architecture has five responsibilities: Repo Scanner, Context Planner, Context Pack Composer, Agent Harness Layer, and an Integration Layer exposing CLI, stdio MCP server, and retriever adapters."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_86b1491f8552eb44bc3212aaebcbd24ef94d8229cb18d0c44eeddaf1d11405e9",
