        "slc_928e45e5f2e65216f62ebedddb63e6fa9c74eb03c7abf82701622028c21d7d51"
      ],
      "text": "The Windows installer adds a selectable OpenCode primary mode named OpenCode++ chosen from the mode picker, with no Slash Commands to remember."
    },
