        "slc_19da749795a8bffd4016389564661f1a10039ae5f8d7c80ed61b3548082828b8"
      ],
      "text": "The plugin explicitly is not an operating-system sandbox; it cannot stop another application from editing a file or prove business semantics from an exit code."
    },
