      ],
      "text": "A harness-led developer mode, opencode-plusplus orchestrate, runs a bounded loop (task, prepare, execute, collect, evaluate, decide, persist) around an explicitly configured executor, reporting finalize, repair, repack, block, rollback, or human-review."
    },
